{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Squire</strong> is an idle RPG that runs quietly in the corner of your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you press a key, your squire attacks. Type an essay, code, or chat \u2013 each keystroke lands a strike. At first you\u2019ll be faster than your squire, but with upgrades, artifacts, and talents, they\u2019ll learn to keep pace\u2026 and eventually take over parts of the grind on their own.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982800/extras/39e4cd59fefc567362d43a0879c5d471.poster.avif?t=1756877263\" width=614 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982800/extras/39e4cd59fefc567362d43a0879c5d471.webm?t=1756877263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982800/extras/39e4cd59fefc567362d43a0879c5d471.mp4?t=1756877263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KEY FEATURES</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always-on-top overlay (move it anywhere on your screen)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Input-driven combat: every key press is an attack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock perks that add mouse clicks or partial automation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized dungeons full of loot, enemies, and surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger with stats, talents, and artifacts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character creator to shape your squire</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work, type, or browse \u2013 your squire fights alongside you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3982800?t=1756877263","background_raw":"https://