e clicks or partial automation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized dungeons full of loot, enemies, and surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger with stats, talents, and artifacts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character creator to shape your squire</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work, type, or browse \u2013 your squire fights alongside you.</p>","developers":["White Cape Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982800/73de1a1999ec416ef9bc4eb8bf4309d1bc253aca/header.jpg?t=1756877263","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257187852,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187852/movie480.mp4?t=1756877261","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187852/movie_max.mp4?t=1756877261"},"name":"Idle Squire Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257187852/c11cdb7da6a8022c1c6da58d9c9bae72214a563f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756877261","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187852/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756877261","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187852/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1756877261"}}],"name":"Idle Squire","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz or faster (any dual core)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["White Cape Games"],"ratings"